1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
At the dawn of the Khmer Empire, golden spires rose to touch the heavens...

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:50,000
A vision of divine kingship united the realm, anchored in compassion and care.

3
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Across the empire, over one hundred hospitals offered sanctuary, medicine, and healing.

4
00:01:30,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Dedicated healers tended to every citizen, viewing service to the sick as service to the divine.

5
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:20,000
An intricate royal highway and communication network connected distant provinces into one beating heart.

6
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Their eternal legacy endures in stone, spirit, and timeless compassion.
